# Project rules

This repo's conventions (architecture, layer responsibilities, naming, error handling,
migration checklist) live in `AGENTS.md` at the repo root — Cursor loads it
automatically. Do not duplicate that content here; only add Cursor-specific
automation/rules in this folder.

Shared skills (e.g. `backend-development`) live in `.agents/skills/` and are
available to the agent for maintenance, debugging, and implementation tasks.

## Git Workflow Rules (CRITICAL)

**IMPORTANT: NEVER auto-commit or push without explicit user permission.**

### Before Any Commit
- ALWAYS ask user before committing: "Tôi sẽ commit các thay đổi này. Đồng ý?"
- List the files that will be committed
- Wait for user confirmation

### Commit Guidelines (per AGENTS.md)
- Each commit = 1 logical change, build must be green
- Write clear commit messages (imperative mood: "Add", "Fix", "Update")
- First line: short summary (< 72 chars)
- Body: explain WHY (not just WHAT)

### Push
- NEVER push without explicit user permission
- Ask: "Đã commit. Bạn muốn tôi push lên không?"

### Examples of Required User Confirmation
```
✅ "Tôi đã fix lỗi lint. Bạn muốn tôi commit và push không?"
✅ "Build thành công. List changes: [files]. Commit?"
❌ NEVER: "Automatically committing..."
❌ NEVER: "Pushing to origin..."
```
